  "body": "Ready for your to move in and enjoy!\r\n\r\n* Beautifully Presented 3 Bedroom Home – where character meets contemporary style, 3 spacious bedrooms full of character\r\n* Stylish Modern Kitchen and Bathroom With Quality Finishes – modern finishes and thoughtful details that make everyday living a blend of function and flair\r\n* Timeless Timber Weatherboard – crafted with enduring timber weatherboard construction, this home combines classic appeal with practical living\r\n* Architectural Ceilings – that create a feeling of space and openness\r\n\r\nThe approximate cost to relocate this house starts from $120,000 + GST within 100kms. This house is a two piece shift with partial roof lower.\r\n\r\nPlease call Myles on 022 657 5070 to arrange a time to view or to find out more about purchasing this house for shifting to your section.\r\n\r\n*Please note depending on the level of interest, the sale of this house may go to a multi offer. \r\n\r\n* Do you need help with Consents, Building Plans, Draughting & Design? Our team can help! Give us a call on 0508 4 RELOCATE (473 562) to book a FREE 20-min consultation with our Design Manager for expert advice on your next project.\r\n* Any other questions? Give us a call on 0508 4 RELOCATE (473 562) to find out how we can help.\r\n\r\nKey Words: Transportable, house for relocation, transportable home, relocatable house, renovate, house for removal, building for removal",
